Provider logos
==============

The SVGs in Jellyfin.Plugin.Oidc/Web/Providers are embedded in the plugin DLL.
Modified 2026-10-13 to use currentColor. Original geometry is retained;
ZITADEL export metadata and unused/invisible elements have been removed.
The names and logos identify their respective products; no endorsement is implied.

